      en: ["Located on the Guajará Bay.", "Crucial for access to the eastern Amazon.", "An important river-marine port serving the Amazon estuary, facilitating regional trade and passenger transport.", "Located within the Federative Republic of Brazil.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Connected to the everyday life and history of the country.", "Influenced by Brazil's predominantly tropical climate."],
