      en: ["Contains massive reserves of high-quality iron ore.", "Operated by Vale.", "The largest open-pit iron ore mine in the world, serving as a pillar of the Brazilian mining sector.", "Located within the Federative Republic of Brazil.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Connected to the everyday life and history of the country.", "Influenced by Brazil's predominantly tropical climate."],
